Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices We take in the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are in between the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and the sky Ready now for adventure We're\Nitching to try Get ready to roam So all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,aboard now we're said to go Set sail to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the ocean so deep Ready for a truly grand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure Well don't you think that sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,really fun All this\Nexcitement second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is out to get you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We hide in this dark forest,\Nscared of zombies and.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All the other creatures here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't head out to sea because\Nwe'll be exposed to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With this body weakened the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to find the\Nwill to keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, just once, before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to walk under the sun\Nto feel it's warmed on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful! How touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been through so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a gut-wrenching story!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not crying, got it? Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't make me cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, you big crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way too compassionate\Nabout this kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, creepy grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only ladies get to persuade people with\Ntheir tears show a little backbone will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're actually looking for\Na guy that steals shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm pretty sure he's the\None if he's coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that just makes things easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick his ass and if\Nthat saves you while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine by me. Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's very kind of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given me new hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Tremoria. A new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The other victims, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not polite to eavesdrop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry about that, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky Curly Eyebrows Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a crappy way to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hotback's laugh for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So is this the secret lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My work is almost finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Shinri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a true work of art!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The work of a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this stupid thing blows\Nup and burns your face off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you even say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shandora, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me anxious with all those unnecessary\Nand frankly hateful remarks of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I prepared a midnight snack for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it spaghetti soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're spilling soup all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish every last plate in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But considering your hatred for plates,\Nperhaps you should choose a better menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How about roast beef or turkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some pita bread or\Nsome sort of sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, solid foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she really die in an accident\Nlike that newspaper article said?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's fine. I'll eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lick it off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Though judging by those injuries,\Nhe must be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a number on him too, just\Nlike the zombies in the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And Hogback said he was almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What we're about to see here is\Nthe creation of a new zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback made all of the other undead\Ncreatures on the island as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but even if he's a genius, it\Ncan't be that easy to bring people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There were tons of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think he made all\Nof them himself, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what we think\Nwe'll see for ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If there really is some kind of secret\Nto bringing the dead back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this has gotta be it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to stand there and\Nstare, you might as well go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that guy was... well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn it\Nwas broke back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But he wasn't a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe you fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,he found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, now what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you never to peek\Ninto my research room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that thing, we swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's the honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We certainly didn't see that\Nzombie you were making. Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you figured out some of my\Nsecrets by now, but you're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In but a few minutes, the\NNight Hunt will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Night Hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Woe and to those foolish enough\Nto wander this island after dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No intruder shall survive the Night Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't properly start the night hunt\Nif you're still buried. Now can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now rise zombie soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you fall\Nyou get back up and attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what makes those\Nzombies so terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. Stop slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip on yourself zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which one of you\Nwants to tell me who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our glorious leader, Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Leader, leader, leader, leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bless the pink and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Liner! Pervert! Pervert! Pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mr. Spirona. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your voice is so deep, it's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just can it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Either be cute or get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have ugly things working for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hair, Hair, Hair, Hair, Hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up. It's starting, it's starting.\NTime for the night hunt. 12 o'clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Midnight. Body up, Master. Master\NMoria. It's time to get up, Master Me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,do it Right, here goes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Moria
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I was having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, aren't those the best, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Moria has been sleeping\Nsince the night hunt four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, that hasn't stopped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that you'd be\Nhungry when you awoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we have prepared a very special meal\Nthat's sure to appease your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're a tough bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing fighters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the pirates that brought\Ndown the island of Enies Lobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,known as the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you pleased?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine what you could do with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that sure came from out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really coming down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we run for the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something really big\Nby the mansion over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind\Nof mark. A mark? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain's clearing the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a flag? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that's a sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you still following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Like he said, what you see is\Na sail of gigantic proportion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so large that seeing the entire\Nthing at once is quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Thriller Bark is not\Nthe island it appears to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, it's actually\Nthe world's largest pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The back of the mansion is\Nwhere you'll find the main mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also the home of Gecko Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, zombie soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The zombie generals will lead the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish off those pirates! March!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you will\Nfind ways to corner and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,overtake those among them\Nthat fear the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we will crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, make me proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If those pirates think they can escape\Nthis place alive, they're gravely mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the preparations complete, my zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In this dark realm are\Nthe ghosts and ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This place we call Thriller Bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They are going to see nothing short\Nof a nightmare to end all nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To the ghost mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that nonsense about\Nstudying zombies, Hogback?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hiding it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're the one making\Nall the creatures on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So out with the truth already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa easy there Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't piss him off
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your accusations are meaningless\Nwhether they're true or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but out of curiosity, what's your proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We read your assistant's obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Victoria Shandora you died ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You cretins!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Change, samurai Ryuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,throw them into the world of\Ndarkness, never to return!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk this over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, doctor, but I'm afraid\Nit's too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The night hunt has already begun, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, upon closer inspection, you're\Nquite the lovely young lady, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, perhaps you would like\Nto show me your panty? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't just It must be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This fellow is of a much better stock than\Nthe zombies you've encountered thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He is one of my zombie generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His body is quite special.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It harkens from the country\Nof Wano in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They call his sort a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and this one supposedly slayed a flying\Ndragon, at least according to the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Force! Force! Force! Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shandora, if you would, my dear,\Nplease open that door for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you have a moment,\NI'd like a sandwich as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was going to cut us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked really scary just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of\Nhere while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the door is wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point. Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuss, fuss, fuss, fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They say when a true master cuts you, you\Ncan just walk away humming and smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not until later that you\Nrealize you've been struck down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three verse humming. There are not
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Nobody's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going in hey give them a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now it opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, since you smashed the lock\Noff, doesn't seem like anyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monsters in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get go, Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't there be a servant around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got to have tons of\Nthem in a mansion this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with the mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a fight in here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They better not have heard Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite audacious,\Naren't you those who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,know our master usually know to fear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a pig\Nsticking out of the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's great are these painting\Nzombies too that's certainly what it looks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,like after All we've seen on this island\Nwe should expect this sort of thing by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll only ask this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Screaming like that isn't very ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.66,0:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame since you're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're better off just staying\Nin your frame and smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now twist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke my spirit half!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this guy's body made of, metal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really on the same crew\Nas those cowards from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style. Nigiri! Nigiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that sushi? Gidisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.14,0:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just picked ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this island's like a party\Neverywhere you go! You! Metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp! Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't tried to smash me, I\Nwould have asked you to join my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not fair, Rug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That takes care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that oh those three
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,friends of yours we fed\Nthem bathed them and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:20:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,gave them a warm bed to sleep in good news\Nright we're all friends like we're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,fall for that no I swear I'm not lying to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you why don't you go\Nsee for yourself right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,up those stairs go ahead\Nhold on something's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong here? Didn't you notice our chef is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,missing huh he was just here a second ago\Nany of you zombie guys see where he went
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,must have nabbed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,him and taken him away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,while we weren't looking\Ngoodbye Sanji rest
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,in peace that ain't cool no biggie it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji I'm sure he's\Ngonna be fine maybe but
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the\Nother three if If the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,zombies were able to\Nkidnap Sanji so easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're in a\Nlot of trouble right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth of the matter is you hardly\Neven put a dent in our numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand, just\Nlost one of your key fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, let's be careful and\Ntry to stick together from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it, you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that we could threaten\Nhim, but even if we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt he would tell us where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll just drag him with\Nus and use him as a guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, guide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, come on. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to die so badly,\Nthen challenge our Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so frightening, I\Ncan't speak his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gecko Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Seven\NWarlords of the Sea, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those missing friends of yours\Nare probably dead or even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky\Nthat you've lost so few.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd save my own skin if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.16,0:21:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you face Gecko Merde...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you face our master,\Nnone of you will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd do well to leave\Nbefore you incur his wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't take\Nadvice from paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Give a message to that\Nstupid master of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him if he lays a single\Nfinger on any of my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick his ass so hard this\Nwhole island will split in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he's alone, it's not like\Nhe's just going to roll over and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it would appear that\Nsome rather terrifying
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,guests have made their way to your abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is with no irony\Nthat I say that they've
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,managed to surprise even\Nthe surprise zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise from your grave and raise your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fiesta time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring those pirates to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride them and drag them through the grime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.72,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone is looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Round and round until you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Samba!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The intruders have all\Nwandered into our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They are our prey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your hunger run wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a feast of terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now awaken, zombie generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fallen warriors shall\Npick up their swords anew!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They number only eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.44,0:24:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll fall quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear them down and offer\Ntheir bodies to our master!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.02,0:24:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie generals, march forth and\Nteach them the meaning of fear!
